WEBVTT

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.294
Hi, friends. Gani here. This is Test Day Calm-Down.

00:00:12.294 --> 00:00:16.588
Sit tall in your chair. Feet flat on the floor.

00:00:16.588 --> 00:00:19.165
Hands resting on your desk. Shoulders soft.

00:00:19.165 --> 00:00:21.741
Before the hard thing, we settle. That is the whole job right now.

00:00:21.741 --> 00:00:26.894
Wiggle your fingers… then let them rest.

00:00:26.894 --> 00:00:32.906
Roll your shoulders once, slow… and let them drop.

00:00:32.906 --> 00:00:38.059
Unclench your jaw. Let your face go soft.

00:00:38.059 --> 00:00:44.071
Your body is settling. Nothing else to fix.

00:00:44.071 --> 00:00:50.082
Now one slow breath pattern. Breathe in: two, three, four.

00:00:50.082 --> 00:00:56.094
Let it out, slow: two, three, four, five, six.

00:00:56.094 --> 00:01:02.106
Again. Breathe in: two, three, four.

00:01:02.106 --> 00:01:07.259
And out, slow and easy: two, three, four, five, six.

00:01:07.259 --> 00:01:09.835
One more, on your own. In… and out.

00:01:09.835 --> 00:01:15.847
A test can look big. You never have to hold the whole thing.

00:01:15.847 --> 00:01:21.859
You only ever start with the first one. Say it with me, quiet or out loud:

00:01:21.859 --> 00:01:27.871
"I can do the first one."

00:01:27.871 --> 00:01:35.600
That sentence is true. The first one is small, and you can start it.

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:41.612
Feet flat. Shoulders soft. Breath slow.

00:01:41.612 --> 00:01:46.765
When you finish, you finish. When it is hard, you breathe and keep going.

00:01:46.765 --> 00:01:51.059
Hands down. One more slow breath… and let it go.

00:01:51.059 --> 00:01:55.353
Eyes open. Look at your teacher.

00:01:55.353 --> 00:01:59.647
You're ready to begin.
